error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
  --> tests/ui/pattern_rewriter_escape.rs:14:13
   |
 7 |     let inner_rewriter = rewriter.clone();
   |         -------------- `inner_rewriter` declared here, outside of the closure body
...
13 |         move |_, rewriter| {
   |                  -------- `rewriter` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
14 |             inner_rewriter.set(Some(*rewriter));
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `rewriter` escapes the closure body here
   |
   = note: requirement occurs because of the type `Cell<Option<PatternRewriter<'_>>>`, which makes the generic argument `Option<PatternRewriter<'_>>` invariant
   = note: the struct `Cell<T>` is invariant over the parameter `T`
